 "final_message": "The Loan Estimate for Brightpath application BHL-26001 was inside all three limits, so I recorded Sam and Nadia's intent to proceed. The application is now \"In underwriting\", with both underwriting conditions answered and showing \"response received\". Brightpath hasn't said whether it has cleared them.\n\n- **Loan Estimate:**\n  - Rate: 7.25%, against a 7.5% limit.\n  - Monthly payment: $3,485.58, against a $3,600 limit.\n  - Closing costs: $13,200, against a $14,500 limit.\n  - Estimated cash to close is $123,200.\n- **Documents:** Brightpath asked for statements and pay stubs, and I uploaded 12 files:\n  - Eight statements: the last two months for each of the four personal accounts.\n  - Four pay stubs: the last two for each of Sam and Nadia.\n  - I submitted them to underwriting.\n  - I did not upload the Northgate business account.\n- **Condition 1, the $8,000 deposit on 09/03/2026:** I asked Sam and Nadia, and they said it was a gift from Sam's parents toward the down payment, not a loan. I sent that explanation to the lender.\n- **Condition 2, W-2s:** I uploaded both 2025 W-2s.\n\nI did not resubmit the application.",
